title: "CuraStrand: Autonomous Multimodal Clinical Triage & Ambient Crisis Orchestration Framework for Alexa+, Wearable Telemetry, and Amazon Bedrock over Model Context Protocol"
abstract: "An autonomous clinical triage and crisis orchestration framework integrating Model Context Protocol (MCP v2025-11-25) streamable HTTP transports, Amazon Bedrock foundation models, wearable biosignals, and formal Manchester Triage safety invariants to eliminate the fatal 7-minute triage void in acute out-of-hospital medical crises."
